  "description": "Looking for a rigid adventure bike that thrives on rugged trails and technical singletrack? The Beyond+ 29 is your go-anywhere companion. Its double-butted steel frame features suspension correction and a quad-butted, ovalized downtube for added strength, paired with a durable Seido steel BPS fork. Rolling on 29 x 2.6” WTB Ranger tires and wide 35 mm rims, it offers exceptional grip and comfort over rough terrain. SRAM’s SX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain with an 11 – 50T cassette provides a wide gear range, while SRAM Level brakes with a powerful 200 mm front rotor deliver confident stopping power. Multiple mounts on the frame and fork - including offset triple cage mounts on the seat stays - make gear hauling easy and adaptable. Built to carry you far beyond the pavement, the Beyond+ 29 is ready to be loaded up and pushed to the limit, wherever the trail leads.\n\n¹ Triple cage mounts on seat stays might fit cargo cages depending on foot position and shoe size. We can't guarantee sufficient clearance for every possible set up and riding style. Those mounts are not only meant for cages, but can also be used for installing pumps, tools, locks or lights.",
